// SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
//
// Ask (surveys) — Survey proto contracts (Story #1269, Epic #1268).
//
// A Survey is the org-scoped top-level container an author builds and
// publishes to collect responses. It moves through a small lifecycle
// (draft → published → closed) and comes in two flavours: a full multi-
// question survey or a lightweight single-question poll.
//
// This is a SKELETON contract — enough to generate stubs and prove the
// wire shape; ask-svc handlers abort UNIMPLEMENTED until story #1270
// fills them in. No handler code exists in this story; the outbox/audit
// mappings below are contract documentation only.

